msgctxt "80"
msgid ""
"(So that was Mikio's father... Let's see what his son has\r\n"
"to say.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Nakahara, you have a visitor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Pardon the intrusion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Pops!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Why, if it isn't Mikio's father!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "It's been quite a while, hasn't it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Well, no need to talk out here. Why don't you come inside?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "So, Aragaki-san, what brings you here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"I heard you were shot recently. I'll add that to my reasons\r\n"
"I'd like you to let Mikio return to an honest life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"I've got a job waiting for him at my brother's factory\r\n"
"in Nagasaki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"No one will know he was a yakuza up there. He'll be able to\r\n"
"get a fresh start."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"What's the big idea, Pops!? You think you can just decide\r\n"
"everything for me!? I'm stayin' here with the Ryudo Family!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"You'll never survive in this kind of world without it taking\r\n"
"everything from you, Mikio."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"Take it from this man, who was shot with an actual gun. This\r\n"
"isn't some television drama, you know!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Tch..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"I'll come by again. Make sure you've gathered up your\r\n"
"things by then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"Urgh, he's always been like this! Everything's always gotta\r\n"
"be exactly his way⑬doesn't matter what I want! And now\r\n"
"he wants to drag me to Nagasaki!? Get real, Pops!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "Mikio..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid ""
"His family's quite famous around here, y'know. They've been\r\n"
"running a traditional restaurant by the station for years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"However, Mikio's always had a tough time with his father.\r\n"
"The reason he ran away was to get out from under his roof..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"He told me he had nowhere else to go, so I decided to\r\n"
"take him in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "Is that right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid ""
"That said, yakuza never live easy. Not just any kid\r\n"
"off the street can make the cut."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid ""
"Mikio's still young, and I know his father's only looking\r\n"
"out for him. If Mikio's ever going to get out of this life,\r\n"
"now might be his best chance."
msgstr ""

